WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.810
You are in the middle of a shopping mall when emergency sirens scream.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.440
A nuclear detonation in under sixty seconds.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:12.510
Most people run to the parking lot and get incinerated in traffic.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.900
Your actual survival ticket? Run downward.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.000
A modern mall basement is reinforced with thousands of tons of concrete and earth,
